
=== touchpad finder: the bitmap reader ===
  ok   finds a bit in the last printed word
  ok   counts words from the RIGHT, not the left
  ok   answers false rather than raising for a bit past the end
  ok   reads a low bit in a word that also sets high bits (bit-precision)

=== touchpad finder: which device ===
  ok   finds the touchpad and not the mouse
  ok   rejects a device with no multitouch slots
  ok   parses every device in the table

=== touchpad finder: capability ===
  ok   reads the finger count the hardware advertises
  ok   does not call a normal buttonpad semi-MT
  ok   flags semi-MT hardware without rejecting it

=== touchpad finder: what an unknown capability must do ===
  ok   offers every slot when the finger count is unknown
  ok   marks what a three-finger pad genuinely cannot do
  ok   leaves a slot it cannot parse alone
  ok   orders equal pads deterministically, not by discovery luck (tie-order)
